5,0,1,talk,Midori,,"Hello everyone. It's a pleasure to meet you all. Since this is our first day and we don't have any clues yet, perhaps we can start by getting to know each other? I'm looking forward to a peaceful discussion.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Rin,,"Hi everyone! I'm so excited to play! This is like a big mystery adventure, right? I'm going to use my super-detective skills to help find the werewolf! Let's all be friends and have fun!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Sakura,,"Hehe, I'm excited too! A mystery adventure sounds like so much fun! I'll help Rin with the detective work! Let's see if we can find any spooky clues together! Who else is ready to play?","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Shion,,"A mystery adventure, is it? You two are certainly energetic. I prefer a more composed approach. Let's see if your ""detective skills"" can actually keep up with a cold, logical analysis of the facts.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Benjamin,,"It is a pleasure to meet you all. I find myself quite charmed by the enthusiasm of Rin and Sakura, though I must agree with Shion that a touch of composure will be our greatest ally in this little drama.","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Sakura"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Midori,,"It is lovely to see such a variety of perspectives already. @Shion and @Benjamin, your focus on composure is very grounding. @Rin and @Sakura, your energy is wonderful! I believe a balance of both will help us stay harmonious.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Benjamin"",""Rin"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Rin,,"@Midori, you're so nice! I agree, balance is important! But being excited helps you notice things others miss! @Shion, I'll show you that my detective skills are super strong! I'm watching everyone very closely! Hehe!","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Midori"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Rin, we'll be the best detective team ever! Hehe! @Shion, don't be so grumpy! Maybe the werewolf is someone who's too serious? I'm going to keep a super close eye on everyone!","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Shion,,"@Sakura, judging a role based on personality is a rookie mistake. Being ""serious"" is simply a matter of efficiency. If you rely on such vague intuitions, you'll be the first to be deceived by a clever mask.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Shion, your assessment is as sharp as ever. Indeed, the most cunning predators often drape themselves in the most unassuming fabrics. I shall be quite interested to see which masks are worn and which eventually slip.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Midori,,"It is a bit frightening to think about masks and predators, but I trust that if we remain kind and honest, we can find the truth together. Does anyone have a specific strategy for the first few days?","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Rin,,"Strategy? Hmm... maybe we should all share a secret or a funny story! That way, we can see who's acting nervous! Hehe, that's what a real detective would do to catch a sneaky wolf! What do you think, @Sakura?","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Sakura,,"That's a great idea, Rin! Hehe! Maybe we can tell a story and see if someone's voice shakes or if they get all fidgety! That would be a super-cool way to find the wolf! What do you think, @Midori?","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Shion,,"@Rin, @Sakura, your ""detective"" methods are nothing more than child's play. Emotional reactions are easily faked by a professional. I suggest we focus on the flow of information and contradictions instead of playing games.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Benjamin,,"@Shion, your pragmatism is a sturdy shield, though I find the whimsy of our younger colleagues quite refreshing. Perhaps we can allow them their games, provided we maintain a logical ledger of the results.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Midori,,I think Benjamin's suggestion is a lovely compromise. Let's enjoy the energy of Rin and Sakura while keeping Shion's logic in mind. I'll do my best to support everyone. I wish you all a peaceful night.,"{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Benjamin"",""Rin"",""Sakura"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
21,0,4,pass,Midori,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
22,0,4,talk,Rin,,"I agree! Let's do both! I'll keep my detective eyes open and my heart happy! Goodnight everyone, I hope the Seer finds a super big clue tonight! See you tomorrow!","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
23,0,4,pass,Rin,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
24,0,4,talk,Sakura,,Goodnight everyone! I'm going to dream about catching the wolf with my super-detective powers! Hehe! I hope the Seer finds something really spooky tonight! See you all tomorrow! Bye-bye!,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
25,0,4,pass,Sakura,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
26,0,4,talk,Shion,,Child's play indeed. I shall spend the night observing the patterns of this group. Let us see if tomorrow brings any actual evidence or just more noise. Goodnight.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
27,0,4,pass,Shion,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
28,0,4,talk,Benjamin,,"A most agreeable conclusion to our first day. I shall retire now to ponder the various roles we all play in this theater. May the night be kind to the innocent. Goodnight, everyone.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
