36,1,1,talk,Midori,,"Good morning, everyone. I hope you all slept well. Since the first night has passed, the Seer now has some information. I wonder if anyone feels ready to share their thoughts or if you've noticed anything suspicious?","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,1,talk,Rin,,"Good morning! I slept great! I wonder if the Seer found a big, scary wolf already? @everyone, does anyone feel like they're acting a little bit different today? I'm using my detective eyes! Hehe!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,1,talk,Sakura,,"Good morning! I'm awake and ready! Hehe! I wonder if the Seer found a super-secret clue! @everyone, if you're the Seer, maybe you can give us a little hint? I bet it would be so exciting!","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,1,talk,Shion,,"@Sakura, asking for hints is a waste of time. If the Seer is among us, they will speak when it is strategically optimal. For now, I'm more interested in who is trying to steer the conversation.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"@Shion, your vigilance is commendable. Indeed, the timing of a revelation is as critical as the information itself. I wonder if the silence of our Seer is a calculated shield or a sign of a most perplexing result.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,2,talk,Midori,,"@Benjamin, you always have such a poetic way of looking at things. I agree that timing is important, but I also worry that too much silence might make us lose trust in one another. Does anyone have a feeling about who we should trust?","{""words"":44,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,2,talk,Rin,,"@Midori, trust is hard! My detective heart says we should trust people who are being super honest! But @Shion is always so grumpy, maybe he's just hiding something? Hehe! What do you think, @Sakura?","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Midori"",""Shion"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Rin, you're so right! Hehe! @Shion is always so serious, it's almost like he's trying too hard to be the smartest person in the room! Maybe he's just a grumpy wolf! What do you think, @Benjamin?","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Shion"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,2,talk,Shion,,"@Rin, @Sakura, your ""detective hearts"" are as shallow as your logic. Attacking me simply because I don't mirror your childish energy is a transparent attempt to deflect. Tell me, is this your strategy—to target the most logical person to avoid scrutiny?","{""words"":41,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Shion, your frustration is quite palpable, though I suspect it is merely the result of battling a whirlwind of enthusiasm. @Sakura, @Rin, while your intuition is spirited, let us not mistake a stern demeanor for a predatory one.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Sakura"",""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,3,talk,Midori,,"It is a bit sad to see us arguing so early. @Rin, @Sakura, please try to be patient with Shion. @Shion, I believe they are just excited. Let's try to find a common ground before we make any hasty decisions.","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Sakura"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,3,talk,Rin,,"@Midori, you're right, I'm sorry for being a bit mean to Shion! I just want to find the wolf! But @Shion, you're still being super grumpy! Maybe you're just nervous because we're so good at this! Hehe!","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Midori"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,3,talk,Sakura,,"@Midori, you're so kind! I'll try to be patient, but it's hard when @Shion is so mean to us! Hehe! Maybe he's just a little bit scared that we'll find him out! Who do you think is the most suspicious, @Benjamin?","{""words"":41,""mentions"":[""Midori"",""Shion"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,3,talk,Shion,,"@Benjamin, I trust you can see through this farce. They are attempting to frame my rationality as ""nervousness"" or ""meanness"" to create an emotional narrative. It is a classic diversion. I'm curious if the Seer is watching this unfold.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,"@Shion, it is indeed a fascinating display of social dynamics. While I find the ""detective"" duo's approach rather quaint, we must be wary; the most effective camouflage is often a facade of innocence and cheer. Who among us is truly the actor?","{""words"":42,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,1,4,talk,Midori,,"Since we must vote today, I feel it's time to be brave. I am the Seer, and I can confirm that @Benjamin is human. I hope this helps us find a path toward harmony and truth. Who should we trust?","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,1,4,talk,Rin,,"@Midori, wow! You're the Seer! That's so cool! Thank you for telling us! Since @Benjamin is a good guy, we can trust him! Now we just have to find the wolf! Who do you think it is, @Benjamin?","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Midori"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,1,4,talk,Sakura,,"@Midori, you're the Seer! That's so amazing! Hehe! Now that we know @Benjamin is a good guy, the mystery is getting even more exciting! @Benjamin, since you're human, who do you think is the sneaky wolf?","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Midori"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,1,4,talk,Shion,,"@Midori, revealing yourself so early is a bold move, though it simplifies the board. Since Benjamin is confirmed human, the wolf is among the rest of us. @Rin, @Sakura, your sudden shift to trust is almost too convenient. Who is the real actor here?","{""words"":44,""mentions"":[""Midori"",""Benjamin"",""Rin"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
55,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,"@Midori, your courage in revealing yourself is most generous, and I am honored to be your anchor of trust. @Shion, your suspicion of the ""detective"" duo is logical, yet let us not forget that a wolf may also hide behind a mask of cold rationality.","{""words"":45,""mentions"":[""Midori"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
