69,2,1,talk,Rin,,"Oh no! @Midori is gone! That's so scary! The werewolf is super mean for attacking the Seer! Now we've lost our secret weapon! @Sakura, @Benjamin, what do we do now? I'm getting really worried!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Midori"",""Sakura"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,2,1,talk,Sakura,,"I know, right?! It's so scary! Hehe... wait, I mean, it's NOT funny at all! The wolf is a big meanie for taking Midori! @Benjamin, you're the only one left who's confirmed human! Please help us!","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Midori"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,"It is a tragedy indeed. The wolf has acted with ruthless efficiency by silencing our Seer. Now, we must rely on our own wits. @Rin, @Sakura, please compose yourselves; panic is the wolf's favorite companion.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,2,2,talk,Rin,,"@Benjamin, you're right! I'll be brave! My detective heart is beating super fast, but I won't let the wolf win! @Sakura, we have to be extra careful now. Since @Midori is gone, who do you think is the meanie?","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Benjamin"",""Sakura"",""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,2,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Rin, I'm trying to be brave too! But it's so hard! Hehe... I mean, it's really scary! Since @Benjamin is a good guy, maybe the wolf is someone who was too quiet? Or maybe they're pretending to be sad! What do you think, @Benjamin?","{""words"":44,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Sakura, sadness can be a very convenient cloak. We must ask ourselves: who benefits most from the Seer's silence? The wolf is now free to weave a narrative without the threat of a divine truth.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,2,3,talk,Rin,,"@Benjamin, that's a super smart way to think! The wolf is probably laughing because they got rid of Midori! @Sakura, do you think the wolf is trying to trick us into trusting each other too much? I'm watching everyone's faces!","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Benjamin"",""Midori"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,2,3,talk,Sakura,,"@Rin, that's a scary thought! Hehe! Maybe the wolf is pretending to be our friend right now! @Benjamin, you're so smart, do you think the wolf is someone who's acting too nice? I'm getting goosebumps!","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,"@Sakura, goosebumps are a natural reaction to the unknown, but let us use them as a signal for vigilance. Indeed, an excess of sweetness can often mask a bitter intent. Between the two of you, who feels the most ""natural""?","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,2,4,talk,Rin,,"@Benjamin, that's a tricky question! I'm just being me, and @Sakura is just being Sakura! We're a team! But if the wolf is pretending to be nice, maybe they're trying to make us fight? I'll trust my detective heart!","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Benjamin"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,2,4,talk,Sakura,,"@Benjamin, that's so mean! You're making me and Rin suspicious of each other! Hehe! But if we're a team, we should stick together to find the meanie! I'll trust Rin, and I hope you trust us too!","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Benjamin"",""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
80,2,4,talk,Benjamin,,"Trust is a fragile thing, and while I appreciate your loyalty to one another, a team can be a sanctuary for a wolf and their possessed ally. We must be clinical. I shall cast my vote with a heavy heart, but a steady hand.","{""words"":44,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
